Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.component.names|Site and Page Templates|
		|testray.main.component.name|Site and Page Templates|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add Page Template
Priority: 4
	Given ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Page Templates|
	When PageTemplate add CP
		|pageTemplateActive|Yes|
		|pageTemplateName|Page Template Name|
Scenario: Add Site Page Template
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Page Templates|
	And PageTemplate add CP
		|pageTemplateActive|Yes|
		|pageTemplateName|Page Template Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'Sites' at locator 'Portlet#HEADER'
	And Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Site Page|
		|pageTemplateName|Page Template Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	Then Page view Page Template
		|page|Site Page|
		|pageTemplateName|Page Template Name|
