Scenario: Delete Page Template
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Page Templates|
	And PageTemplate add CP
		|pageTemplateActive|Yes|
		|pageTemplateName|Page Template Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Page Templates|
	And PageTemplate delete CP
		|pageTemplateName|Page Template Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Page Templates|
	Then PageTemplate view Default CP
		|pageTemplateNameList|Blog,Content Display Page,Wiki|
