Scenario: Edit Page Template Description
Priority: 4
	Given ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Page Templates|
	When PageTemplate add CP
		|pageTemplateActive|Yes|
		|pageTemplateName|Page Template Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Page Templates|
	And PageTemplate edit Description
